ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Spell Focus|APPLIEDTO:Conjuration|TYPE:General.IdRagerBonusFeat|DESC:Any spells you cast of your chosen school of magic are more difficult to resist.
